 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 667011,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Consider the following example. Which instance attribute(s) does <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">dc_1</code> have?\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">class SuperClass:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;def __init__(self):\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;self.feat_1 = 1\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;self.feat_2 = \"\"\n\n&nbsp;&nbsp;def bc_display(self):\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;print(f\"Superclass: {self.feat_2}\")\n\nclass SubClass(SuperClass):\n&nbsp;&nbsp;def dc_display(self):\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;print(f\"Subclass: {self.feat_2}\")\n\ndc_1 = SubClass()\n</pre>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1330006,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">feat_2</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "dc_1 also inherits feat_1 from SuperClass."
    },
    {
     "id": 1330007,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">feat_1</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">feat_2</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">dc_1</code> inherits <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">feat_1</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">feat_2</code> from <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">SuperClass</code>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1330008,
     "content_html": "None",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "dc_1 is of type SubClass, which is inherited from SuperClass and inherits all SuperClass's instance attributes."
    }
   ],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "multiple-choice"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
