     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">dc_1</code> inherits <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">feat_1</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">feat_2</code> from <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">SuperClass</code>."
